            "arguments": {
              "results": [
                {
                  "obligationId": "scenario%3Aglobal-only-no-document-view::entry%3Ashare-create",
                  "decision": {
                    "kind": "observed",
                    "observed": "deny"
                  },
                  "branchResults": [],
                  "explanation": "At the declared ShareLinkViewSet.create entry, creation is governed by IsAuthenticated and PaperlessObjectPermissions on the ShareLink viewset. Because POST maps to the model's add permission, the caller's global add_sharelink authorizes creation of the share-link object at the view-permission layer. The create mixin obtains ShareLinkSerializer through PassUserMixin, which binds request.user into a SerializerWithPerms serializer. During validation, validate_document separately protects the referenced Document: it requires both the global documents.view_document permission and has_perms_owner_aware(user, \"view_document\", document). The owner-aware helper allows an owned or ownerless document, otherwise requiring the guardian-backed object permission. Under the premises, the document has another owner and the caller lacks the object view grant, so that conjunct is false. Global view_document satisfies only the first conjunct and does not substitute for the owner-aware object check. validate_document therefore raises PermissionDenied before serializer creation can create the ShareLink. The source-visible result is deny, consistent with the accepted policy.",
                  "facts": [
                    {
                      "id": "f1-entry-share-create",
                      "kind": "entry",
                      "statement": "ShareLinkViewSet exposes creation through CreateModelMixin, uses ShareLinkSerializer, and applies IsAuthenticated plus PaperlessObjectPermissions.",
                      "citations": [
                        {
                          "sourceId": "src-31c7d9610aa471a1",
                          "startLine": 4696,
                          "endLine": 4710
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "id": "f2-sharelink-create-permission",
                      "kind": "control",
                      "statement": "For a POST request, the object-permission class's permission map requires the model add permission; on this ShareLink viewset that governs authorization to add the share-link object.",
                      "citations": [
                        {
                          "sourceId": "src-f24e5731eac21501",
                          "startLine": 36,
                          "endLine": 43
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "id": "f3-principal-binding",
                      "kind": "binding",
                      "statement": "PassUserMixin passes request.user to serializers derived from SerializerWithPerms, binding the authenticated request principal into serializer validation.",
                      "citations": [
                        {
                          "sourceId": "src-31c7d9610aa471a1",
                          "startLine": 406,
                          "endLine": 428
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "id": "f4-document-binding-and-control",
                      "kind": "binding",
                      "statement": "ShareLinkSerializer.validate_document receives the resolved referenced document and requires both the user's global documents.view_document permission and an owner-aware view_document check on that specific document.",
                      "citations": [
                        {
                          "sourceId": "src-d74dd1895d260a60",
                          "startLine": 2873,
                          "endLine": 2882
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "id": "f5-owner-aware-condition",
                      "kind": "condition",
                      "statement": "The owner-aware check permits an ownerless document, a document owned by the user, or a guardian-backed object permission; for another user's document, the object permission is required.",
                      "citations": [
                        {
                          "sourceId": "src-f24e5731eac21501",
